$255 bölgesinde elimdeki tüm </span><a class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-brand text-[length:inherit] font-inherit hover:underline" href="https://x.com/hashtag/AAVE">#AAVE</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">&#x27;lerin satışını yaptıktan sonra alım yeri olarak tek ilgilendiğim yerin $180 dolayları olduğundan bahsetmiştim.
Alıntıladığım analizdeki önem arz eden notları grafik üzerinde bulabilirsiniz.

Fiyat bu bölgeden an</span><button type="button" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-blue-500 text-[length:inherit] font-normal"> Show more</button></div></div></div></article></div></div><div class="@container -ml-0.5 flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-1"><div class="inline-flex items-center transition min-w-0 flex-1 text-gray-700"><span class="group inline-flex items-center hover:text-blue-500"><button class="gap-1 inline-flex items-center border border-solid font-bold has-[svg:only-child]:px-0 transition disabled:pointer-events-none focus-visible:outline disabled:opacity-50 justify-center bg-transparent rounded-full text-inherit h-9 min-w-9 px-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-5 text-body hover:bg-mix-current hover:bg-mix-amount-10 active:bg-mix-current active:bg-mix-amount-15 focus-visible:bg-mix-current focus-visible:bg-mix-amount-10 outline-current -m-2 shrink-0 cursor-pointer border-transparent p-0 text-body size-9 [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-[1.25em] [&amp;&gt;[data-engagement-icon]]:size-[1.25em] group-hover:bg-mix-current group-hover:bg-mix-amount-10" aria-label="Reply" type="button" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" data-icon="icon-reply-stroke" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="1em" height="1em" display="flex" role="img" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1.751 10c0-4.42 3.584-8 8.005-8h4.366c4.49 0 8.129 3.64 8.129 8.13 0 2.96-1.607 5.68-4.196 7.11l-8.054 4.46v-3.69h-.067c-4.49.1-8.183-3.51-8.183-8.01zm8.005-6c-3.317 0-6.005 2.69-6.005 6 0 3.37 2.77 6.08 6.138 6.01l.351-.01h1.761v2.3l5.087-2.81c1.951-1.08 3.163-3.13 3.163-5.36 0-3.39-2.744-6.13-6.129-6.13H9.756z"></path></svg></button><button aria-hidden="true" class="text-subtext2 min-w-[calc(1em+4px)] cursor-pointer ps-1 pe-0 whitespace-nowrap tabular-nums transition disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50" tabindex="-1" type="button"><span class="inline-flex tabular-nums" data-animated-count="true"><span class="x-animated-count-visual inli